        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Anderson, Connie Smith, Taylor Swift\n- Songs: \"Once a Day\", \"We Are Never Ever Getting Back Together\"\n- Albums: \"Red\"\n- Publications: Rolling Stone, Time\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Anderson wrote the song \"Once a Day.\"\n- Connie Smith recorded \"Once a Day\" as her debut single.\n- Taylor Swift recorded \"We Are Never Ever Getting Back Together\" for her fourth studio album \"Red\" in 2012.\n- Rolling Stone named \"We Are Never Ever Getting Back Together\" the second best song of 2012.\n- Time ranked \"We Are Never Ever Getting Back Together\" fourth in its end-of-year poll for 2012.",
